🚀 TOP 20 AWS INTERVIEW QUESTIONS
Java + Spring Boot + Banking Domain Quick Revision Sheet

═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
1. WHAT IS AWS?
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Answer:

    AWS (Amazon Web Services) is a cloud computing platform
    that provides compute, storage, networking, database,
    security, analytics, and AI services on a pay-as-you-go
    pricing model.

Examples:

    • EC2
    • S3
    • Lambda
    • RDS
    • ECS

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

2. WHAT IS AMAZON EC2?
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Answer:

    EC2 (Elastic Compute Cloud) provides virtual servers
    in the cloud.

Use Case:

    Run Spring Boot Microservices

Benefits:

    • Scalable
    • Highly Available
    • Flexible

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

3. WHAT IS AMAZON S3?
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Answer:

    S3 (Simple Storage Service) is an object storage service.

Used For:

    • Files
    • Images
    • Backups
    • Logs
    • Videos

Key Feature:

    Durability = 99.999999999%
    (11 Nines)

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

4. DIFFERENCE BETWEEN EBS AND S3?
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

EBS

    • Block Storage
    • Attached To EC2
    • Low Latency
    • Database Storage

S3

    • Object Storage
    • Independent Service
    • Massive Scalability
    • File Storage

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

5. WHAT IS AWS LAMBDA?
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Answer:

    AWS Lambda is a serverless compute service that executes
    code without managing servers.

Benefits:

    • No Server Management
    • Auto Scaling
    • Pay Per Use

Banking Example:

    Process Payment Events

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

6. WHAT IS API GATEWAY?
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Answer:

    API Gateway is a managed service used to create,
    publish, secure and monitor APIs.

Flow:

    Client
      ↓
    API Gateway
      ↓
    Lambda / ECS / EC2
      ↓
    Response

Benefits:

    • Security
    • Rate Limiting
    • Authentication
    • Monitoring

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

7. WHAT IS IAM?
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Answer:

    IAM (Identity and Access Management) manages AWS
    authentication and authorization.

Used For:

    • Users
    • Roles
    • Policies
    • Permissions

Interview Point:

    IAM is the core AWS security service.

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

8. IAM USER VS IAM ROLE
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

IAM User

    • Permanent Credentials
    • Human User/Application
    • Username & Password

IAM Role

    • Temporary Credentials
    • AWS Services
    • Assumed Dynamically

Example:

    ECS Task → Assume IAM Role

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

9. WHAT IS A VPC?
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Answer:

    VPC (Virtual Private Cloud) allows creation of isolated
    private networks inside AWS.

Components:

    • Subnets
    • Route Tables
    • Internet Gateway
    • NAT Gateway
    • Security Groups

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

10. PUBLIC SUBNET VS PRIVATE SUBNET
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Public Subnet

    • Direct Internet Access
    • Web Servers
    • Load Balancers

Private Subnet

    • No Direct Internet Access
    • Databases
    • Internal Applications

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

11. WHAT IS APPLICATION LOAD BALANCER (ALB)?
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Answer:

    ALB distributes incoming traffic across multiple
    servers or containers.

Features:

    • Path Based Routing
    • Host Based Routing
    • SSL Termination
    • High Availability

Flow:

    User
      ↓
     ALB
      ↓
    ECS / EC2
      ↓
    Spring Boot Service

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

12. WHAT IS AUTO SCALING?
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Answer:

    Automatically adds or removes resources based
    on workload.

Benefits:

    • High Availability
    • Cost Optimization
    • Improved Performance

Example:

    CPU > 70%

        2 Servers
            ↓
        10 Servers

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

13. WHAT IS CLOUDWATCH?
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Answer:

    AWS CloudWatch is a monitoring and observability service.

Used For:

    • Metrics
    • Logs
    • Alarms
    • Dashboards

Interview Favorite:

    CloudWatch monitors applications and infrastructure.

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

14. WHAT IS SNS?
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Answer:

    SNS (Simple Notification Service) provides
    publish-subscribe messaging.

Flow:

         Application
               ↓
              SNS

        ↙      ↓      ↘

      Email   SMS   Lambda

Use Cases:

    • Alerts
    • Notifications
    • Broadcast Messages

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

15. WHAT IS SQS?
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Answer:

    SQS (Simple Queue Service) decouples applications
    through message queues.

Flow:

    Producer
       ↓
      SQS
       ↓
    Consumer

Benefits:

    • Reliable Processing
    • Message Buffering
    • Fault Tolerance

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

16. SNS VS SQS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

SNS

    • Push Model
    • Broadcast Message
    • Multiple Subscribers

SQS

    • Pull Model
    • Queue Processing
    • One Consumer At A Time

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

17. WHAT IS RDS?
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Answer:

    RDS (Relational Database Service) is a managed
    relational database service.

Supports:

    • Oracle
    • PostgreSQL
    • MySQL
    • SQL Server
    • MariaDB

Banking Use Case:

    Transaction Databases

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

18. WHAT IS DYNAMODB?
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Answer:

    DynamoDB is a fully managed NoSQL database.

Features:

    • Millisecond Latency
    • Auto Scaling
    • Serverless
    • High Throughput

Use Cases:

    • User Sessions
    • Shopping Carts
    • Event Storage

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

19. ECS VS EKS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

ECS

    • AWS Managed Container Service
    • Simpler Setup
    • AWS Native
    • Easier Management

EKS

    • Managed Kubernetes
    • Portable Across Clouds
    • Industry Standard
    • More Flexible

Interview Answer:

    ECS = Easier
    EKS = More Flexible

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

20. WHAT IS CLOUDFRONT?
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Answer:

    CloudFront is AWS Content Delivery Network (CDN).

Benefits:

    • Faster Content Delivery
    • Global Edge Locations
    • Reduced Latency
    • Improved Performance

